---
description: React/Next.js conventions for Career Compass frontend
globs: app/**/*.js,components/**/*.js
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use Next.js App Router conventions (app/ directory routing).
- Plain JavaScript only — never generate .ts or .tsx files.
- Style with Tailwind CSS utility classes; avoid separate CSS files unless
  necessary for complex animation keyframes.
- Components should be responsive by default (mobile, tablet, desktop).
- Reference the wireframe's numbered indicators as code comments where
  relevant, for later documentation traceability (see instructions.md
  Section 4).